 config('hit',[ref(15),ref(11)],[[32,1],[88,0]],0,'One backward RECOIL with recovery. Both knees flex and bearded head/chest lean back32, RIGHT hand still grips original short hook, LEFT forearm retains keel shield. Supported boots, unchanged torso length; recover progressively through hips, shoulders, elbows and knees88 into original ready. No death, incoming objects or effect.',2026102403)
